<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Agen Apet Pandeglang | Supplier Kebutuhan Masyarakat & Dapur MBG</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Agen Apet Pandeglang melayani supplier kebutuhan masyarakat dan dapur MBG se-Kabupaten Pandeglang dengan layanan cepat, rapi, dan terpercaya." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1e2f23" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg: #f5f0e6;
      --paper: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      --paper-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      --text: #1b1a16;
      --muted: #5f5a4f;
      --line: rgba(27,26,22,.12);
      --brand: #24452f;
      --brand-2: #8d5f31;
      --accent: #d9c09b;
      --shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(34, 30, 18, .12);
      --radius: 24px;
      --radius-sm: 14px;
      --container: min(1180px, calc(100vw - 32px));
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:"Manrope", sans-serif;
      color:var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(141,95,49,.16), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 10%, rgba(36,69,47,.10), transparent 26%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f2e9 0%, #f1ebde 100%);
      min-height:100vh;
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }

    body::before{
      content:"";
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      pointer-events:none;
      opacity:.18;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(27,26,22,.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(27,26,22,.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 28px 28px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.65), transparent 85%);
    }

    img{max-width:100%;display:block}
    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
    button{font:inherit}

    .container{
      width:var(--container);
      margin-inline:auto;
    }

    .reveal{
      opacity:0;
      transform:translateY(28px);
      transition:opacity .8s ease, transform .8s ease;
    }
    .reveal.is-visible{
      opacity:1;
      transform:translateY(0);
    }

    .stagger > *{
      opacity:0;
      transform:translateY(24px);
      animation:rise .8s ease forwards;
    }
    .stagger > *:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.08s}
    .stagger > *:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.18s}
    .stagger > *:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.28s}
    .stagger > *:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.38s}
    .stagger > *:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.48s}

    @keyframes rise{
      to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    }

    .site-header{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:30;
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      background:rgba(247,242,233,.65);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,26,22,.08);
    }

    .nav{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:18px;
      min-height:78px;
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      font-weight:800;
      letter-spacing:-.02em;
    }

    .brand-mark{
      width:44px;
      height:44px;
      border-radius:14px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), #3d6a49 60%, #5a8b67 100%);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25),
        0 12px 24px rgba(36,69,47,.2);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .brand-mark::before,
    .brand-mark::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    }
    .brand-mark::before{
      width:44px;height:44px;left:-12px;top:-20px;
      transform:rotate(25deg);
    }
    .brand-mark::after{
      width:18px;height:18px;right:7px;bottom:7px;
      background:rgba(217,192,155,.6);
      box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .brand-text{
      line-height:1.05;
    }
    .brand-text strong{
      display:block;
      font-size:1rem;
    }
    .brand-text span{
      display:block;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.75rem;
      font-weight:600;
    }

    .nav-links{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:28px;
      color:#3d3a33;
      font-weight:600;
      font-size:.95rem;
    }

    .nav-links a{
      position:relative;
    }
    .nav-links a::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      bottom:-6px;
      width:100%;
      height:2px;
      background:var(--brand);
      transform:scaleX(0);
      transform-origin:left;
      transition:transform .28s ease;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}

    .nav-actions{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
    }

    .menu-btn{
      display:none;
      width:46px;
      height:46px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:14px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.65);
      cursor:pointer;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
    }
    .menu-btn span,
    .menu-btn span::before,
    .menu-btn span::after{
      display:block;
      width:18px;
      height:2px;
      background:var(--text);
      border-radius:999px;
      position:relative;
      transition:.25s ease;
    }
    .menu-btn span::before,
    .menu-btn span::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
    }
    .menu-btn span::before{top:-6px}
    .menu-btn span::after{top:6px}

    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:10px;
      padding:14px 20px;
      border-radius:999px;
      border:1px solid transparent;
      font-weight:700;
      transition:transform .2s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, background .25s ease, border-color .25s ease;
      cursor:pointer;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }

    .btn:hover{
      transform:translateY(-2px);
    }
    .btn:active{
      transform:translateY(0) scale(.98);
    }

    .btn-primary{
      color:#f7f3ea;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), #31583c);
      box-shadow:0 16px 34px rgba(36,69,47,.22);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover{
      box-shadow:0 22px 44px rgba(36,69,47,.28);
      filter:saturate(1.05);
    }

    .btn-secondary{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.58);
      border-color:rgba(27,26,22,.12);
      color:var(--text);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .hero{
      padding:46px 0 28px;
    }

    .hero-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
      gap:28px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }

    .hero-copy{
      padding:34px 0 18px;
    }

    .eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:10px;
      padding:10px 14px;
      border:1px solid rgba(36,69,47,.14);
      border-radius:999px;
      color:var(--brand);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.46);
      font-size:.86rem;
      font-weight:800;
      letter-spacing:.02em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .eyebrow-dot{
      width:8px;
      height:8px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:#6f9a78;
      box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(111,154,120,.12);
    }

    h1,h2,h3{
      font-family:"DM Serif Display", serif;
      letter-spacing:-.03em;
      line-height:.96;
      margin:0;
    }

    h1{
      font-size:clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.1rem);
      margin-top:18px;
      max-width:12ch;
    }

    .lead{
      margin:20px 0 28px;
      font-size:clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.16rem);
      line-height:1.8;
      color:var(--muted);
      max-width:62ch;
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:14px;
      margin-bottom:30px;
    }

    .hero-meta{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap:14px;
      margin-top:26px;
    }

    .meta-item{
      padding:16px 0 0;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(27,26,22,.12);
    }
    .meta-item strong{
      display:block;
      font-size:1.35rem;
      letter-spacing:-.04em;
    }
    .meta-item span{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.92rem;
    }

    .hero-panel{
      position:relative;
      min-height:620px;
      border-radius:calc(var(--radius) + 8px);
      overflow:hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.64), rgba(255,255,255,.4)),
        linear-gradient(160deg, #e7dcc8 0%, #d8c0a4 45%, #b99667 100%);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);
      isolation:isolate;
    }

    .hero-panel::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:auto -10% -12% auto;
      width:72%;
      aspect-ratio:1;
      border-radius:44% 56% 60% 40% / 37% 40% 60% 63%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, rgba(255,255,255,.65), rgba(255,255,255,.08) 56%, transparent 60%),
                  linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(36,69,47,.78), rgba(36,69,47,.24));
      filter: blur(.2px);
      transform:rotate(-10deg);
    }

    .hero-panel::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:-12%;
      top:10%;
      width:58%;
      aspect-ratio:1;
      border-radius:50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 40%, rgba(255,255,255,.42), transparent 60%);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    }

    .warehouse{
      position:absolute;
      inset:auto 0 0 0;
      height:54%;
      padding:28px;
      display:grid;
      align-content:end;
      z-index:2;
    }

    .warehouse-box{
      background:rgba(254,252,248,.78);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.56);
      border-radius:22px;
      padding:22px;
      box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(76,57,34,.16);
    }

    .warehouse-box h3{
      font-size:1.8rem;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .warehouse-box p{
      margin:0 0 16px;
      color:#5f5a4f;
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .supply-line{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:10px;
    }

    .chip{
      padding:10px 12px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:.86rem;
      font-weight:700;
      background:rgba(36,69,47,.08);
      color:var(--brand);
      border:1px solid rgba(36,69,47,.12);
    }

    .section{
      padding:72px 0;
    }

    .section-head{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr .8fr;
      gap:24px;
      align-items:end;
      margin-bottom:28px;
    }
    .section-head p{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.8;
      max-width:58ch;
    }

    h2{
      font-size:clamp(2.3rem, 4.8vw, 4.4rem);
      max-width:10ch;
    }

    .services-layout{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
      gap:22px;
    }

    .service-block{
      min-height:270px;
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      padding:28px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);
    }

    .service-primary{
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,.25), transparent 20%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #254330, #1a3022 65%, #132419 100%);
      color:#f7f3ea;
      display:grid;
      align-content:space-between;
    }

    .service-primary p{
      color:rgba(247,243,234,.76);
      max-width:52ch;
      line-height:1.8;
    }

    .number-badge{
      display:inline-flex;
      width:44px;
      height:44px;
      border-radius:50%;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      font-weight:800;
      margin-bottom:16px;
    }

    .service-stack{
      display:grid;
      gap:22px;
    }

    .service-note{
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.86), rgba(255,255,255,.68)),
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(217,192,155,.32), rgba(36,69,47,.08));
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .service-note p{
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.75;
      max-width:42ch;
    }

    .list-clean{
      margin:18px 0 0;
      padding:0;
      list-style:none;
      display:grid;
      gap:12px;
    }

    .list-clean li{
      display:flex;
      align-items:flex-start;
      gap:10px;
      color:#312d26;
      line-height:1.65;
    }

    .list-clean li::before{
      content:"";
      width:10px;
      height:10px;
      margin-top:.5em;
      border-radius:50%;
      flex:0 0 auto;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
      box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(36,69,47,.08);
    }

    .coverage{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap:18px;
      margin-top:20px;
    }

    .coverage-item{
      padding:18px 0;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(27,26,22,.12);
    }
    .coverage-item strong{
      font-size:1.05rem;
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }
    .coverage-item span{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.94rem;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    .process{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr;
      gap:26px;
      align-items:start;
    }

    .process-side{
      position:sticky;
      top:104px;
      padding:22px 0;
    }

    .process-side p{
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.8;
      max-width:40ch;
    }

    .timeline{
      position:relative;
      display:grid;
      gap:18px;
    }

    .timeline::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:16px;
      top:16px;
      bottom:16px;
      width:2px;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(36,69,47,.28), rgba(141,95,49,.12));
    }

    .step{
      position:relative;
      margin-left:0;
      padding:22px 22px 22px 56px;
      border-radius:22px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.62);
      border:1px solid rgba(27,26,22,.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(53,43,27,.08);
      transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
    }

    .step:hover{
      transform:translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow:0 20px 42px rgba(53,43,27,.12);
    }

    .step::before{
      content:attr(data-step);
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      top:20px;
      width:34px;
      height:34px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), #45624c);
      color:#fff;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-size:.85rem;
      font-weight:800;
      box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(36,69,47,.08);
    }

    .step h3{
      font-size:1.55rem;
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }

    .step p{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.75;
    }

    .cta{
      padding-bottom:84px;
    }

    .cta-wrap{
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
      border-radius:34px;
      padding:32px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 84% 20%, rgba(217,192,155,.3), transparent 18%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #1d3525 0%, #234230 56%, #40634c 100%);
      color:#f8f4ec;
      box-shadow:0 26px 60px rgba(25,46,32,.24);
    }

    .cta-wrap::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:auto -4% -18% auto;
      width:280px;
      height:280px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,.22), transparent 62%);
    }

    .cta-grid{
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap:20px;
      align-items:end;
    }

    .cta-wrap p{
      color:rgba(248,244,236,.78);
      line-height:1.75;
      max-width:58ch;
      margin:12px 0 0;
    }

    .footer{
      padding:24px 0 40px;
      color:#4d473e;
    }

    .footer-row{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:20px;
      align-items:center;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(27,26,22,.1);
      padding-top:20px;
      font-size:.95rem;
    }

    .footer-links{
      display:flex;
      gap:18px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .mobile-panel{
      display:none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px){
      .hero-grid,
      .services-layout,
      .section-head,
      .process,
      .cta-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .hero-panel{
        min-height:520px;
      }

      .process-side{
        position:relative;
        top:auto;
      }

      .coverage{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .nav-links,
      .nav-actions .btn-secondary,
      .nav-actions .btn-primary{
        display:none;
      }

      .menu-btn{
        display:flex;
      }

      .mobile-panel{
        display:block;
        max-height:0;
        overflow:hidden;
        transition:max-height .35s ease;
        border-top:1px solid rgba(27,26,22,.08);
      }

      .mobile-panel.open{
        max-height:320px;
      }

      .mobile-panel-inner{
        padding:14px 0 18px;
        display:grid;
        gap:10px;
      }

      .mobile-link{
        padding:12px 0;
        color:#2f2c26;
        font-weight:700;
        border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(27,26,22,.08);
      }

      .mobile-actions{
        display:flex;
        flex-wrap:wrap;
        gap:10px;
        margin-top:10px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px){
      .hero{
        padding-top:24px;
      }

      .hero-copy{
        padding-top:12px;
      }

      h1{
        max-width:10ch;
      }

      .hero-meta{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .hero-panel{
        min-height:470px;
      }

      .service-block,
      .cta-wrap{
        padding:24px;
      }

      .footer-row{
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Navigasi utama">
        <a href="#beranda" class="brand" aria-label="Agen Apet Pandeglang">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="brand-text">
            <strong>Agen Apet Pandeglang</strong>
            <span>Supplier kebutuhan masyarakat & dapur MBG</span>
          </span>
        </a>

        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#layanan">Layanan</a>
          <a href="#proses">Proses</a>
          <a href="#cakupan">Cakupan</a>
          <a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
        </div>

        <div class="nav-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#layanan">Lihat Layanan</a>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#kontak">Hubungi Sekarang</a>
          <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Buka menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobilePanel">
            <span></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <div class="mobile-panel" id="mobilePanel">
        <div class="mobile-panel-inner">
          <a class="mobile-link" href="#layanan">Layanan</a>
          <a class="mobile-link" href="#proses">Proses</a>
          <a class="mobile-link" href="#cakupan">Cakupan</a>
          <a class="mobile-link" href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
          <div class="mobile-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#layanan">Lihat Layanan</a>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#kontak">Hubungi Sekarang</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="beranda">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy stagger">
          <div class="eyebrow">
            <span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Melayani se-Kabupaten Pandeglang
          </div>
          <h1>Agen kebutuhan pokok yang rapi, cepat, dan siap suplai.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Agen Apet Pandeglang melayani supplier kebutuhan masyarakat dan kebutuhan dapur MBG
            dengan pendekatan yang terorganisir, komunikasi jelas, dan pengiriman yang dapat diandalkan.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#kontak">Ajukan Kebutuhan</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#proses">Pelajari Proses</a>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-meta" aria-label="Informasi ringkas">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <strong>Supplier</strong>
              <span>Kebutuhan masyarakat harian dan stok rutin.</span>
            </div>
